<title>UK: Credit Lyonnais sets warrants on Swiss shares.</title>
<headline>Credit Lyonnais sets warrants on Swiss shares.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Credit Lyonnais Financial Products (Guernsey) Ltd has issued five million American-style call warrants, on a basket of Swiss financial/insurance shares, lead manager Credit Lyonnais said.</p>
<p>The basket consists of shares of Winterthur Schweizerische Versicherungs-Gesellschaft, Swiss Reinsurance Co, and Credit Suisse. One basket is controlled by 100 shares.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    3,000 CHF		 PREMIUM	10.4 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     2.80 CHF		  GEARING	10.61 TIMES</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 11.JUN.97-25.MAY.98   PAYDATE	11.JUN.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWISS		     MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  2,971 CHF</p>
<p>-- Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
